      "created_at": "2021-03-18T15:40:45Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-18T15:40:45Z",
      "body": "The right to be forgotten is a core application need that relates to security and privacy. US laws are requiring this as well. Lets do it. But perhaps we need to make a special privacy option since this is only tangential to security?",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
