      "created_at": "2021-03-18T16:47:37Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-18T16:53:19Z",
      "body": "Till it's not required as functionality in application, this requirement or requirements, if we keep them, belong to V1.8.\r\n\r\nedit: Actually those requirements makes sense and belong where they are.\r\n\r\nWe checked it from end-user perspective, and it is not clearly required to provide mentioned functionalities via user-interface.\r\n\r\nBut if user makes call to helpdesk (as an example), then in the application must be present a method or procedure to export and/or delete user-related data.",
